{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evergrowing Video Store</strong> is an idle game in which you play as Jeff, the only employee of a retro video store. One night, the video store is attacked by a swarm of monsters, and he has to face it... using the store's powers !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the talent tree and make Jeff stronger (and weirder) to beat his enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with the talent tree on the right, and look what happens on the simulation on the left !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evergrowing Video Store is a mix between an idle game and a survivors-like experience! But it also features a gigantic and monstrous talent tree ! (Reminiscent of Path of Exile !) We really hope you'll enjoy testing out different builds !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast talent tree, with various retro weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is only playable with mouse.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3942270?t=1757956067","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3942270?t=1757956067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942270/26b5b4ebb50504d6da1455c60207d6a27a1ba251/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757956067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942270/26b5b4ebb50504d6da1455c60207d6a27a1ba251/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757956067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evergrowing Video Store</strong> is an idle game in which you play as Jeff, the only employee of a retro video store. One night, the video store is attacked by a swarm of monsters, and he has to face it... using the store's powers !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the talent tree and make Jeff stronger (and weirder) to beat his enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with the talent tree on the right, and look what happens on the simulation on the left !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evergrowing Video Store is a mix between an idle game and a survivors-like experience! But it also features a gigantic and monstrous talent tree ! (Reminiscent of Path of Exile !) We really hope you'll enjoy testing out different builds !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast talent tree, with various retro weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is only playable with mouse.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Milkshake Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942270/9a463284315b7756b5a89754ee3d50b06e7e0fc1/header.jpg?t=1757956067","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Evergrowing Video Store. Developed by Milkshake Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257196171,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196171/movie480.mp4?t=1757591667","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196171/movie_max.mp4?t=1757591667"},"name":"Trailer Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196171/282a6c038366d56a1271d17ae3e2ea778993be5c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757591667","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196171/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757591667","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196171/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757591667"}}],"name":"Evergrowing Video Store","package_grou